    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divinastros is a roguelike deck builder focused on making massive scores with your cards! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033030/extras/04e4fba67bc24944356a6f44e4126730.poster.avif?t=1736895475\" width=600 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033030/extras/04e4fba67bc24944356a6f44e4126730.webm?t=1736895475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033030/extras/04e4fba67bc24944356a6f44e4126730.mp4?t=1736895475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your cards and make combinations with Tarot Cards and the Zodiac to achieve the best build possible! Fight Greek beasts and Gods, meet different characters, uncover new Tarot Decks and make your way to Mount Olimpus. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033030/extras/5e5294461f09f7d69985c475fcdb56df.poster.avif?t=1736895475\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033030/extras/5e5294461f09f7d69985c475fcdb56df.webm?t=1736895475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033030/extras/5e5294461f09f7d69985c475fcdb56df.mp4?t=1736895475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is unique! Adapt your gameplay to the different Zodiac Signs and beat the many bosses that'll try to stop you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033030/extras/4ab4046c7fecbc654599923f4532b228.poster.avif?t=1736895475\" width=598 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033030/extras/4ab4046c7fecbc654599923f4532b228.webm?t=1736895475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033030/extras/4ab4046c7fecbc654599923f4532b228.mp4?t=1736895475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet various friendly mythological creatures and characters. Each one of them offers you their help and new Quests to complete!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033030/extras/5aa6b8bb4e52850ce5c74d822e4592ad.poster.avif?t=1736895475\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033030/extras/5aa6b8bb4e52850ce5c74d822e4592ad.webm?t=1736895475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033030/extras/5aa6b8bb4e52850ce5c74d822e4592ad.mp4?t=1736895475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 88 Unique Major Arcana Tarot Cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 12 Zodiac Signs, each one with their unique gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 8 Invocations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 4 Different Tarot Decks</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divinastros is a roguelike deck builder focused on making massive scores with your cards! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033030/extras/04e4fba67bc24944356a6f44e4126730.poster.avif?t=1736895475\" width=600 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033030/extras/04e4fba67bc24944356a6f44e4126730.webm?t=1736895475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033030/extras/04e4fba67bc24944356a6f44e4126730.mp4?t=1736895475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your cards and make combinations with Tarot Cards and the Zodiac to achieve the best build possible! Fight Greek beasts and Gods, meet different characters, uncover new Tarot Decks and make your way to Mount Olimpus. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033030/extras/5e5294461f09f7d69985c475fcdb56df.poster.avif?t=1736895475\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033030/extras/5e5294461f09f7d69985c475fcdb56df.webm?t=1736895475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033030/extras/5e5294461f09f7d69985c475fcdb56df.mp4?t=1736895475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is unique! Adapt your gameplay to the different Zodiac Signs and beat the many bosses that'll try to stop you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033030/extras/4ab4046c7fecbc654599923f4532b228.poster.avif?t=1736895475\" width=598 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033030/extras/4ab4046c7fecbc654599923f4532b228.webm?t=1736895475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033030/extras/4ab4046c7fecbc654599923f4532b228.mp4?t=1736895475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet various friendly mythological creatures and characters. Each one of them offers you their help and new Quests to complete!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033030/extras/5aa6b8bb4e52850ce5c74d822e4592ad.poster.avif?t=1736895475\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033030/extras/5aa6b8bb4e52850ce5c74d822e4592ad.webm?t=1736895475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033030/extras/5aa6b8bb4e52850ce5c74d822e4592ad.mp4?t=1736895475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 88 Unique Major Arcana Tarot Cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 12 Zodiac Signs, each one with their unique gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 8 Invocations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 4 Different Tarot Decks</p>",
